{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":72523,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793450556152,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2017,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tuNnjFxwRNo2nOEHb4ndxZFPSz1.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1331460","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kyō Nukui is a shut-in high schooler with a love for music, often posting his music online under the fake name of HibikiP. One day, an anonymous sender wants to meet him at a park, to which Kyō agrees, thinking it to be a middle-aged man interested in discussing music like him. However, the anonymous sender turns out to be three elementary school girls Jūn Goto, Nozomi Momijidani, and Sora Kaneshiro, who request that he play his music with their band in an upcoming concert. They perform first for him, and despite being highly impressed with their musical skills and vintage instruments, is still unsure about his decision.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p430XEwb3Y0YxKpjyQXHkDhj78i.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p430XEwb3Y0YxKpjyQXHkDhj78i.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72523/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"1338268","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kyō agrees to help the girls with the concert, but Masayoshi Sawatari, the head of the orphanage where they live, asks him to dissuade them.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-07-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rEL1fGhsD3ORIq8BxwesTowpchM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/