Text":{"value":"2017-08-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uo9n829QWKNh0nJJqwn9A66KCe0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uo9n829QWKNh0nJJqwn9A66KCe0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72523/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"1353497","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kyō discovers that his online friend was not Yuzuha, but Kiryu Yume, and Yuzuha was acting in her stead. When Kiryu decides to cease all connections with Kyō and the others, they decide to find a way to cheer her up.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-09-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vomaVZnYZcwvJu4xIvP1uyplpx5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vomaVZnYZcwvJu4xIvP1uyplpx5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72523/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"1353499","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kiryu and Yuzuha gain permission to leave the island and transfer to the local school. While helping Yuzuha around the city, Kyō ends up spending some quality time with her, triggering the other girls' jealousy.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2017-09-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yEZc1P10s1Bbl0D5AgIr38IuBro.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yEZc1P10s1Bbl0D5AgIr38IuBro.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/72523/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"1368381","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Enraged with how much time Kyō spends with the girls of Lien de Famille, Kiryu decides to form her own act with Yuzuha and Kurumi's he